{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120391","id":3889682826,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7n19mK","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120391","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120391.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120391.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120391","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120391/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120391/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120391/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2c2adf55d1844776c114e27d3ca9c51c71bc72df","number":120391,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"GLTF: Fix spotlight angle attenuation and handle equal inner and outer angles","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Fixes #120387\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe glTF spec says that the inner angle must be less than the outer angle. However, it is possible for the original values to be different, but become equal as a result of floating-point error. Therefore, we need to handle the case where they are equal.\r\n\r\nWith this PR, importing equal inner and outer angle values will display as a circle:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1126\" height=\"832\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-06-18 005304\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fbcbabcb-4ff9-47c6-a877-949db15b87f7\" />\r\n\r\nAdditionally, we need to guard against the possibility of exporting values that are equal, or close enough to be interpreted as equal, since the glTF specification does not allow them to be equal. Therefore, with this PR, exporting near-zero angle attenuation spotlights will always result in the inner angle being slightly less than the outer angle (up to 0.999999x).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nFurthermore, this PR also fixes a problem where the spot angle behavior was inverted. It seems that the spot angle attenuation parameter had its behavior flipped at some point, but the glTF code was not updated to match.\r\n\r\nHere is a test with an inner angle of 0.079 and an outer angle of 0.089:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"948\" height=\"682\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-06-18 005529\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0bdfdc7e-ca1e-478a-99aa-4e65f8b40d09\" />\r\n\r\nHere is a test with an inner angle of 0.05 and an outer angle of 0.089:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1030\" height=\"764\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-06-18 005611\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/67f57da3-ed47-46ab-8524-a78bf2ae6d95\" />\r\n\r\nHere is a test with an inner angle of 0.0 and an outer angle of 0.089:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1008\" height=\"794\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-06-18 005558\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3f181934-efa5-46ce-a039-0afe48d7f83b\" />\r\n\r\nAll of these are approximations, since Godot's spotlights do not quite match glTF.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_